> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=63613&start=1930&SessionId=a415d3c7b405d40bacc34c5bbbb71d2b
> User maravillasdsu (279568)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.41.201.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9b2ed1d3eb970acd5770c36191a6d098","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"stephygirl\"] Did you have centerpieces for your rehearsal dinner? I can&#039;t decide how much decorating I need to do for that.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901048,"PostDate":1437685866,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283264\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283264-stephygirl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">stephygirl<\/span><\/a> Did you have centerpieces for your rehearsal dinner? I can't decide how much decorating I need to do for that.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erikahime@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.191.153.24","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421821507,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281815.jpg?_r=1431031761","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":278,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Danielle1","Id":281815,"Name":"Danielle1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"167.219.0.140","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1ebac567bef49630b02c0f3732c1b578","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Danielle1\"] - Sorry I think you asked this before and I translated \"rehearsal\" to \"reception\" in my head :)&amp;nbsp;! &amp;nbsp;We did not have any centerpieces for the rehearsal dinner. &amp;nbsp;We pretty much did a no-frills rehearsal dinner - no music, no decor, etc. &amp;nbsp;I think everyone had a good time and nobody really noticed or cared about the lack of decor. &amp;nbsp;It was mostly just a fun dinner to welcome everyone - and my husband and I gave quick speeches thanking everyone for coming (sans microphone).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any update from your WC on size of your reception location?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901250,"PostDate":1438021196,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281815\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281815-danielle1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Danielle1<\/span><\/a> - Sorry I think you asked this before and I translated \"rehearsal\" to \"reception\" in my head <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0! \u00a0We did not have any centerpieces for the rehearsal dinner. \u00a0We pretty much did a no-frills rehearsal dinner - no music, no decor, etc. \u00a0I think everyone had a good time and nobody really noticed or cared about the lack of decor. \u00a0It was mostly just a fun dinner to welcome everyone - and my husband and I gave quick speeches thanking everyone for coming (sans microphone).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any update from your WC on size of your reception location?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79219-stephygirls-planning-thread-beach-palace-june-28-2015\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79219-stephygirls-planning-thread-beach-palace-june-28-2015\/<\/a>","Email":"srehm2@gmail.com","IpAddress":"167.219.0.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432742363,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283264.jpg?_r=1432750548","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stephygirl","Id":283264,"Name":"stephygirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.41.201.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"108de7fa45894cfab748f002392f52b9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"stephygirl\"] Did you have to rent lights for the rehearsal dinner? I&#039;m glad to know that your guests enjoyed it without decor - the rentals get so expensive. &amp;nbsp;My WC told me that the sky bare south can have up to 200 for a buffet dinner... &amp;nbsp;Gama (where I&#039;m renting lighting and decor from) also seemed okay with it... so I guess I will just go with it! I&#039;m having a welcome party on Thursday night before my wedding and its scheduled for the sky bar north... I&#039;m slightly worried about it just looking like my reception. &amp;nbsp;I hope the reception will still be special!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901253,"PostDate":1438024773,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283264\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283264-stephygirl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">stephygirl<\/span><\/a> Did you have to rent lights for the rehearsal dinner? I'm glad to know that your guests enjoyed it without decor - the rentals get so expensive. \u00a0My WC told me that the sky bare south can have up to 200 for a buffet dinner... \u00a0Gama (where I'm renting lighting and decor from) also seemed okay with it... so I guess I will just go with it! I'm having a welcome party on Thursday night before my wedding and its scheduled for the sky bar north... I'm slightly worried about it just looking like my reception. \u00a0I hope the reception will still be special!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erikahime@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.191.153.24","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421821507,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281815.jpg?_r=1431031761","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":278,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Danielle1","Id":281815,"Name":"Danielle1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.194.109.139","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c971245d5c4c64f6331b058a14a84783","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Danielle1\"] - 200 people?!?!? I can&#039;t even picture how that could be physically possible, but I guess they know better than me. &amp;nbsp;I just can&#039;t imagine all the tables and a large enough dance floor being able to fit. &amp;nbsp;But like I said, they should know better than me. &amp;nbsp;To give you some idea - you should check out this pinterest board, especially the aerial view and the sky bar pictures. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/allinclusivegal\/beach-palace\/&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/allinclusivegal\/beach-palace\/ &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also, watch the video at this link - you can see the aerial view of a setup of a wedding on the sky bar south:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/weddings.palaceresorts.com\/en\/hotel\/beach-palace&#039;&gt;http:\/\/weddings.palaceresorts.com\/en\/hotel\/beach-palace&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We did not rent lights for the rehearsal dinner - it was bright enough even after the sun went down. &amp;nbsp;I think they had set up lights for us? &amp;nbsp;I can&#039;t exactly remember! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m sure your reception will be special - not only because of the music and decor differences, but also because people will be so excited about your special day!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901254,"PostDate":1438027741,"PostContent":null,"Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79219-stephygirls-planning-thread-beach-palace-june-28-2015\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79219-stephygirls-planning-thread-beach-palace-june-28-2015\/<\/a>","Email":"srehm2@gmail.com","IpAddress":"167.219.0.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432742363,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283264.jpg?_r=1432750548","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stephygirl","Id":283264,"Name":"stephygirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.41.201.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4e82793dc0380e8253dc87a916be716f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"stephygirl\"] Thanks! That pinterest board is definitely helpful. &amp;nbsp;Does the sky bar north have a pool as well? Are those open during the day? It does look small to me, but I&#039;m going to try to just go with what they say and hope for the best! haha :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901256,"PostDate":1438028287,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283264\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283264-stephygirl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">stephygirl<\/span><\/a> Thanks! That pinterest board is definitely helpful. \u00a0Does the sky bar north have a pool as well? Are those open during the day? It does look small to me, but I'm going to try to just go with what they say and hope for the best! haha <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erikahime@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.191.153.24","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421821507,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281815.jpg?_r=1431031761","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":278,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Danielle1","Id":281815,"Name":"Danielle1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"99dc05b6c1e8ecf6fc401ebdd1136c78","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Danielle1\"] Really? 200? That actually surprises me because I heard that it&#039;s not a very large space. I think I remember another bride on here who has close to 100 guests and may not have been able to accommodate them on the rooftop terrace.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have been to BP and I don&#039;t remember the space being that large on the roof, but if so, that&#039;s pretty amazing!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"stephygirl\"] It&#039;s good to hear you didn&#039;t need lights. I purchased a few LED paper lanterns and planned to use those on the tables for the rehearsal\/welcome dinners. I didn&#039;t want to invest much into those dinners since the set-up and general pricing is not cheap at all. I figured I would allocate any available budget I had to the actual day.. plus it will make the wedding reception look that much better :D&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901257,"PostDate":1438028527,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281815\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281815-danielle1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Danielle1<\/span><\/a> Really? 200? That actually surprises me because I heard that it's not a very large space. I think I remember another bride on here who has close to 100 guests and may not have been able to accommodate them on the rooftop terrace.<\/p>\n<p>I have been to BP and I don't remember the space being that large on the roof, but if so, that's pretty amazing!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283264\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283264-stephygirl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">stephygirl<\/span><\/a> It's good to hear you didn't need lights. I purchased a few LED paper lanterns and planned to use those on the tables for the rehearsal\/welcome dinners. I didn't want to invest much into those dinners since the set-up and general pricing is not cheap at all. I figured I would allocate any available budget I had to the actual day.. plus it will make the wedding reception look that much better <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419441414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.41.201.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c2b3d1d2181289ea1c6af67961c4de41","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"perianjay\"] It looks small to me too! Now I am nervous... I&#039;ve told her several times though that we would have around 100 people. I think we&#039;ll have 90 at the least and maybe up to 110. I wonder if I should just request a location change? It is such a pretty space though.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901258,"PostDate":1438028686,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> It looks small to me too! Now I am nervous... I've told her several times though that we would have around 100 people. I think we'll have 90 at the least and maybe up to 110. I wonder if I should just request a location change? It is such a pretty space though.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erikahime@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.191.153.24","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421821507,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281815.jpg?_r=1431031761","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":278,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Danielle1","Id":281815,"Name":"Danielle1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"74602da8a42ac74eefdc403266e39e24","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Danielle1\"] I know what you mean! We&#039;re having ours there, but a much smaller amount of people (32). Did you ask your WC how many it would fit comfortably with a dance floor etc?\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901259,"PostDate":1438029057,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281815\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281815-danielle1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Danielle1<\/span><\/a> I know what you mean! We're having ours there, but a much smaller amount of people (32). Did you ask your WC how many it would fit comfortably with a dance floor etc?<br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419441414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.41.201.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"438d16daea88abe3995fd7edd8f5cbae","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"perianjay\"] yes I did ask her and she said 200... which doesn&#039;t seem possible (not that I need to fit 200 comfortably, but I do need space for 100). I just emailed her again to confirm that that includes space for a dance floor, DJ, all of the tables, etc. It&#039;s so pretty that I want it to work out, but I&#039;m terrified of getting there and needing to change everything at the last minute.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901260,"PostDate":1438029609,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> yes I did ask her and she said 200... which doesn't seem possible (not that I need to fit 200 comfortably, but I do need space for 100). I just emailed her again to confirm that that includes space for a dance floor, DJ, all of the tables, etc. It's so pretty that I want it to work out, but I'm terrified of getting there and needing to change everything at the last minute.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erikahime@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.191.153.24","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421821507,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281815.jpg?_r=1431031761","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":278,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Danielle1","Id":281815,"Name":"Danielle1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.194.109.139","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0120f7396ba94dda8c98fd435ca09be3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Danielle1\"] - The sky bar north has a pool as well, and both are open for the day. &amp;nbsp;At night, they kind of barricade your side off with tables for the buffet, dj, etc. &amp;nbsp;However, note that the other side of the sky bar WILL be open to the general public. &amp;nbsp;Also, there is a women&#039;s bathroom on the sky bar south side and a men&#039;s bathroom on the sky bar north side. &amp;nbsp;So, there will likely be people sneaking over from the other side to use the bathroom on your event side. &amp;nbsp;I know there was a wedding on the Sky Bar the same night as our rehearsal dinner - we all partied on the sky bar afterwards and some of us girls snuck over to the other side to use the bathroom over by the wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also, I&#039;m sure your BP coordinator will tell you that 100 to 110 people is fine. &amp;nbsp;She will probably tell you that you can fit up to 200. &amp;nbsp;But keep in mind that is probably the MAXIMUM they can fit up there. &amp;nbsp;Meaning that is a very tightly packed, bare bones space. &amp;nbsp;If you&#039;re looking for a decent-sized dance floor (one where you don&#039;t have to break down tables), buffet tables, cake table, DJ, and tables for all your guests - my guess is it would be a very tight space for your group size. &amp;nbsp;Sorry to stress you out and make you anxious about this, I just want to make sure you consider your options.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I just separately asked my husband \"do you think you could fit a 110 person wedding on the sky bar at beach palace\" and here was his response:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;segoe ui&#039;, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;[7\/27\/2015 2:51 PM] : &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#000000;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;segoe ui&#039;, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;not comfortably?&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&#039;segoe ui&#039;, sans-serif;color:#000000;\"&gt;seems a bit much&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&#039;segoe ui&#039;, sans-serif;color:#000000;\"&gt;you could&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&#039;segoe ui&#039;, sans-serif;color:#000000;\"&gt;just packed&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"perianjay\"] - i think your lanterns will be perfect! &amp;nbsp;Totally know what you mean about wanting to allocate most of your budget to the wedding; that&#039;s exactly how we felt!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901264,"PostDate":1438030494,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281815\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281815-danielle1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Danielle1<\/span><\/a> - The sky bar north has a pool as well, and both are open for the day. \u00a0At night, they kind of barricade your side off with tables for the buffet, dj, etc. \u00a0However, note that the other side of the sky bar WILL be open to the general public. \u00a0Also, there is a women's bathroom on the sky bar south side and a men's bathroom on the sky bar north side. \u00a0So, there will likely be people sneaking over from the other side to use the bathroom on your event side. \u00a0I know there was a wedding on the Sky Bar the same night as our rehearsal dinner - we all partied on the sky bar afterwards and some of us girls snuck over to the other side to use the bathroom over by the wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also, I'm sure your BP coordinator will tell you that 100 to 110 people is fine. \u00a0She will probably tell you that you can fit up to 200. \u00a0But keep in mind that is probably the MAXIMUM they can fit up there. \u00a0Meaning that is a very tightly packed, bare bones space. \u00a0If you're looking for a decent-sized dance floor (one where you don't have to break down tables), buffet tables, cake table, DJ, and tables for all your guests - my guess is it would be a very tight space for your group size. \u00a0Sorry to stress you out and make you anxious about this, I just want to make sure you consider your options.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I just separately asked my husband \"do you think you could fit a 110 person wedding on the sky bar at beach palace\" and here was his response:<\/p>\n<div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:'segoe ui', sans-serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">[7\/27\/2015 2:51 PM] : <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#000000\"><span  style=\"font-family:'segoe ui', sans-serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">not comfortably?<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'segoe ui', sans-serif;color:#000000;\">seems a bit much<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'segoe ui', sans-serif;color:#000000;\">you could<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:'segoe ui', sans-serif;color:#000000;\">just packed<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div><br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> - i think your lanterns will be perfect! \u00a0Totally know what you mean about wanting to allocate most of your budget to the wedding; that's exactly how we felt!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79219-stephygirls-planning-thread-beach-palace-june-28-2015\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79219-stephygirls-planning-thread-beach-palace-june-28-2015\/<\/a>","Email":"srehm2@gmail.com","IpAddress":"167.219.0.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432742363,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283264.jpg?_r=1432750548","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stephygirl","Id":283264,"Name":"stephygirl","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1948,"TotalPages":195,"CurrentPage":1930,"NextPage":1940,"PreviousPage":1920,"LastPage":1940},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
