Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.65.17.253","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76974,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c8a2307d272e4777b92a285248ef1db7","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kmk2016\" post=\"1850934\" timestamp=\"1400375145\"]\nThere are a bunch of us from Alberta! I would suggest reaching out to a great TA who can help you narrow down some choices... Mine has been fantastic planning so far out, you may want to call\/email her! Laurielee.ca \nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]Thanks for the info. What TA is she from?\nCongrats everyone","Attachments":[],"Id":1850995,"PostDate":1400422504,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kmk2016, on 18 May 2014 - 02:05 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>There are a bunch of us from Alberta! I would suggest reaching out to a great TA who can help you narrow down some choices... Mine has been fantastic planning so far out, you may want to call\/email her! Laurielee.ca <br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThanks for the info. What TA is she from?<br \/>Congrats everyone\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kdevries@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"50.65.17.253","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359780644,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265520.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kardev","Id":265520,"Name":"Kardev","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.24.237","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76974,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1400423438,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3a82e9751e3c94d5913a638902bd54c1","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Kardev\" post=\"1850995\" timestamp=\"1400418904\"]\nThanks for the info. What TA is she from?\nCongrats everyone[\/quote]She works for Tier One and specializes in assisting brides with DW and planning. If you were a US bride I would recommend Wright (they run this board!!) but for Canadians our packages are different and Tier One\/Laurie Lee has amazing relationships with the TOs and Resorts.  \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1851003,"PostDate":1400423427,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Kardev, on 18 May 2014 - 02:15 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\nThanks for the info. What TA is she from?<br>\nCongrats everyone<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nShe works for Tier One and specializes in assisting brides with DW and planning. If you were a US bride I would recommend Wright (they run this board!!) but for Canadians our packages are different and Tier One\/Laurie Lee has amazing relationships with the TOs and Resorts.  <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390260208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.65.17.253","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76974,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b3dc70b0bc3a3c8aa202601f6e682f7d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kmk2016\" post=\"1851003\" timestamp=\"1400419827\"]\nShe works for Tier One and specializes in assisting brides with DW and planning. If you were a US bride I would recommend Wright (they run this board!!) but for Canadians our packages are different and Tier One\/Laurie Lee has amazing relationships with the TOs and Resorts.  \nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]Thanks again. What resort are you going with if you don&#039;t mind me asking?","Attachments":[],"Id":1851009,"PostDate":1400426085,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kmk2016, on 18 May 2014 - 02:30 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>She works for Tier One and specializes in assisting brides with DW and planning. If you were a US bride I would recommend Wright (they run this board!!) but for Canadians our packages are different and Tier One\/Laurie Lee has amazing relationships with the TOs and Resorts.  <br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThanks again. What resort are you going with if you don't mind me asking?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kdevries@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"50.65.17.253","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359780644,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265520.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kardev","Id":265520,"Name":"Kardev","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.24.237","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76974,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1400427101,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"44394ae966c4fe880577e0adb7cc830a","RawContent":"We finally settled on a Karisma Property...because of the look of the resorts and their quality when it comes to gourmet inclusive offerings.  90% sure it will be Sensatori but I&#039;m heading down in 3 weeks with my MOH for the June Dress Rehearsal to make sure I love it as much in person. (There&#039;s a chance I would choose Generations RM too- but I want to keep the price reasonable for our guests so I&#039;m considering Fives as well. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1851015,"PostDate":1400427064,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We finally settled on a Karisma Property...because of the look of the resorts and their quality when it comes to gourmet inclusive offerings.  90% sure it will be Sensatori but I'm heading down in 3 weeks with my MOH for the June Dress Rehearsal to make sure I love it as much in person. (There's a chance I would choose Generations RM too- but I want to keep the price reasonable for our guests so I'm considering Fives as well. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390260208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.161.201.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76974,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b3fd7f8390adb4f9e157919816752699","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats everyone!! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1852127,"PostDate":1401136307,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats everyone!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dnyomba@gmail.com","IpAddress":"207.161.66.184","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390119458,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsSam","Id":276191,"Name":"FutureMrsSam","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.38.3.13","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76974,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c1f40a83b61b6da66275f873a4c7044a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@kardev&amp;nbsp; Congrats! I too am an Alberta DW Bride but for 2015&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have an amazing TA who lives in AB and specializes in Destination Weddings. Her name is Kelsie Abrahamason of Travel Only, She is s a certified WOW Specialist for Hard Rock Hotels!&amp;nbsp;She also has several Resort Specific Training that is provided to Travel Agents to become certified in their Wedding Packages. I think the last one she went down for in Mexico was the Romance Certification for Paridisus Resorts. I have only been planning for a month and I have been blown away by here.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I emailed her initially requesting information, received a phone call in 5 minutes, and by 3pm in the afternoon I had quotes from my 6 choices, and 5 days later had negotiated my rates, secured booking, and gave deposit. Yesterday I received 2 emails with 9 pdf&#039;s to give to my guests when I send out STD&#039;s or to put on our wedding&amp;nbsp;website. Info&amp;nbsp;regarding&amp;nbsp; guests flights, hotel details, credits given to guests, excursions, etc...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;All of the material I receive from her instructs our guests to contact her directly which is so helpful. She took a day out of her recent trip to Mexico to visit HRH Cancun and brought back samples of the Colin Cowie Wedding Collection for me to physically feel and to top it off she gratuitiously gave me a Site Visit Certificate for 4 days and 3 nights to visit the Hard Rock Hotel!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I can&#039;t say enough good things about her.... If you would like her info, please PM me.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1852205,"PostDate":1401206358,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@kardev\u00a0 Congrats! I too am an Alberta DW Bride but for 2015<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have an amazing TA who lives in AB and specializes in Destination Weddings. Her name is Kelsie Abrahamason of Travel Only, She is s a certified WOW Specialist for Hard Rock Hotels!\u00a0She also has several Resort Specific Training that is provided to Travel Agents to become certified in their Wedding Packages. I think the last one she went down for in Mexico was the Romance Certification for Paridisus Resorts. I have only been planning for a month and I have been blown away by here.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I emailed her initially requesting information, received a phone call in 5 minutes, and by 3pm in the afternoon I had quotes from my 6 choices, and 5 days later had negotiated my rates, secured booking, and gave deposit. Yesterday I received 2 emails with 9 pdf's to give to my guests when I send out STD's or to put on our wedding\u00a0website. Info\u00a0regarding\u00a0 guests flights, hotel details, credits given to guests, excursions, etc...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>All of the material I receive from her instructs our guests to contact her directly which is so helpful. She took a day out of her recent trip to Mexico to visit HRH Cancun and brought back samples of the Colin Cowie Wedding Collection for me to physically feel and to top it off she gratuitiously gave me a Site Visit Certificate for 4 days and 3 nights to visit the Hard Rock Hotel!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I can't say enough good things about her.... If you would like her info, please PM me.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angela.jackson@urs.com","IpAddress":"208.38.3.13","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1399559909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277894.jpg?_r=1399556581","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"angelajackson","Id":277894,"Name":"angelajackson","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.71.74.153","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76974,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0fa23fc541c797e8437366e3cfda95c6","RawContent":"Is anyone hearing anything about the Royalton resort that is being built?","Attachments":[],"Id":1870742,"PostDate":1409970033,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Is anyone hearing anything about the Royalton resort that is being built? \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mcgillapple@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"70.53.155.53","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1402282593,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"mariak","Id":278327,"Name":"mariak","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"188.29.166.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76974,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"962101334a9fae0d650c717b665234b5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are getting married in November 2015 and have decided on Dreams Riviera for the ceremony and then Secrets Maroma for our honeymoon. We originally wanted the ceremony at Secrets but like you they do not allow children. &amp;nbsp;If anyone has been to either I&#039;d appreciate your thoughts.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1870880,"PostDate":1410117631,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are getting married in November 2015 and have decided on Dreams Riviera for the ceremony and then Secrets Maroma for our honeymoon. We originally wanted the ceremony at Secrets but like you they do not allow children. \u00a0If anyone has been to either I'd appreciate your thoughts.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"justineatack@gmail.com","IpAddress":"31.54.1.116","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410015456,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279711.jpg?_r=1410256327","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bride2b15","Id":279711,"Name":"Bride2b15","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.51.0.49","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76974,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ce4679fecff75ee597d24ad1a14c6cee","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello, I am booked for Moon Palace for June 11th 2016!! Super excited about about the wedding and find myself drowning in wedding ideas all day LOL! &amp;nbsp;If there is any other Moon brides that have any tips or suggestions please shoot them my way. TIA&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Priscilla&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899220,"PostDate":1435173433,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello, I am booked for Moon Palace for June 11th 2016!! Super excited about about the wedding and find myself drowning in wedding ideas all day LOL! \u00a0If there is any other Moon brides that have any tips or suggestions please shoot them my way. TIA<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Priscilla\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"priscilla_alanis@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.51.0.49","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1434143374,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"priscilla31185","Id":283516,"Name":"priscilla31185","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":19,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
