{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":20,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1620,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1885417,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1423234994,"LastPoster":{"Id":266979,"Name":"DianaSRZ","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266979.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1898728,"PostDate":1434519457,"PostContent":"@Wafflesmom not bad at all! I just wish I was able to see an actual wedding at this location to h...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"calipso78@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.223.28.9","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362601629,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266979.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DianaSRZ","Id":266979,"Name":"DianaSRZ","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78746,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7eae8d89882ffe7b242c073300094ac3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Wafflesmom\"] Oh that&#039;s awesome then!! I don&#039;t really understand why mine is&amp;nbsp;more difficult&amp;nbsp;to accomodate.. there are literally SO MANY places I could see them hanging the structure on the sky deck.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;That&#039;s awesome about the vendor fee. Which photographer are you going with??&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1885490,"PostDate":1423259933,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279721\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279721-wafflesmom\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Wafflesmom<\/span><\/a> Oh that's awesome then!! I don't really understand why mine is\u00a0more difficult\u00a0to accomodate.. there are literally SO MANY places I could see them hanging the structure on the sky deck.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That's awesome about the vendor fee. Which photographer are you going with??<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419441414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.143.225.195","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78746,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b17c8c0938b7b661ecba797da4da8b59","RawContent":"[quote name=\"perianjay\" post=\"1885490\" timestamp=\"1423256333\"]\n@[member=\"Wafflesmom\"] Oh that&#039;s awesome then!! I don&#039;t really understand why mine is more difficult to accomodate.. there are literally SO MANY places I could see them hanging the structure on the sky deck.\n \nThat&#039;s awesome about the vendor fee. Which photographer are you going with??[\/quote]That is weird. Have you spoken to other Beach Palace brides about this to see if they were charged? If you haven&#039;t already found it and are on facebook, there&#039;s a really good forum for Palace and Hard Rock brides. I&#039;ve seen a fee Beach Palace brides use the string lighting. It would be interesting to see if they were charged. \n\nThe sky deck looks amazing! It&#039;s nice and private and just very picturesque :)\n\nMy palace wedding coordinator was actually the one who gave me a heads up about the change in vendor fees so she made a note to keep the old one for me. We&#039;re going with Samuel Luna, his style is so artistic! I love Lancelotti&#039;s style too.","Attachments":[],"Id":1885491,"PostDate":1423260354,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>perianjay, on 06 February 2015 - 09:58 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279721\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279721-wafflesmom\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Wafflesmom<\/span><\/a> Oh that's awesome then!! I don't really understand why mine is\u00a0more difficult\u00a0to accomodate.. there are literally SO MANY places I could see them hanging the structure on the sky deck.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nThat's awesome about the vendor fee. Which photographer are you going with??<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThat is weird. Have you spoken to other Beach Palace brides about this to see if they were charged? If you haven't already found it and are on facebook, there's a really good forum for Palace and Hard Rock brides. I've seen a fee Beach Palace brides use the string lighting. It would be interesting to see if they were charged. <br><br>\nThe sky deck looks amazing! It's nice and private and just very picturesque <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nMy palace wedding coordinator was actually the one who gave me a heads up about the change in vendor fees so she made a note to keep the old one for me. We're going with Samuel Luna, his style is so artistic! I love Lancelotti's style too. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410102185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1431039162","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.51.171.25","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78746,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by perianjay, 07 February 2015 - 02:54 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1423320895,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ddcf157142959d83822106b79517b4e9","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Wafflesmom\" post=\"1885491\" timestamp=\"1423256754\"]\nThat is weird. Have you spoken to other Beach Palace brides about this to see if they were charged? If you haven&#039;t already found it and are on facebook, there&#039;s a really good forum for Palace and Hard Rock brides. I&#039;ve seen a fee Beach Palace brides use the string lighting. It would be interesting to see if they were charged.\n\nThe sky deck looks amazing! It&#039;s nice and private and just very picturesque :)\n\nMy palace wedding coordinator was actually the one who gave me a heads up about the change in vendor fees so she made a note to keep the old one for me. We&#039;re going with Samuel Luna, his style is so artistic! I love Lancelotti&#039;s style too.[\/quote]Yea, there was another bride who was charged for the hanging of the lights. I&#039;m probably going to have no way out of it, but at least I found out about it now! I am also looking into other options as well. I really love the standing chandeliers that LatinAsia offers. They look like they actually give off much more lighting than the lanterns because I&#039;m afraid those lanterns aren&#039;t going to do much for actual brightness.. maybe just more of a light ambiance lighting. Which is totally great and will photograph well, but after speaking with another bride.. it sounds like you need a lot of them for the affect.\n\nSamuel Luna is really nice as well! I was also looking into them - great choice!! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1885531,"PostDate":1423320878,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Wafflesmom, on 06 February 2015 - 10:05 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>That is weird. Have you spoken to other Beach Palace brides about this to see if they were charged? If you haven't already found it and are on facebook, there's a really good forum for Palace and Hard Rock brides. I've seen a fee Beach Palace brides use the string lighting. It would be interesting to see if they were charged.<br><br>\nThe sky deck looks amazing! It's nice and private and just very picturesque <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nMy palace wedding coordinator was actually the one who gave me a heads up about the change in vendor fees so she made a note to keep the old one for me. We're going with Samuel Luna, his style is so artistic! I love Lancelotti's style too.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Yea, there was another bride who was charged for the hanging of the lights. I'm probably going to have no way out of it, but at least I found out about it now! I am also looking into other options as well. I really love the standing chandeliers that LatinAsia offers. They look like they actually give off much more lighting than the lanterns because I'm afraid those lanterns aren't going to do much for actual brightness.. maybe just more of a light ambiance lighting. Which is totally great and will photograph well, but after speaking with another bride.. it sounds like you need a lot of them for the affect.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Samuel Luna is really nice as well! I was also looking into them - great choice!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419441414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.167.128.142","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78746,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4b7adcaea95e6f9719863aaee62710b1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hola all you planning wedding couples :) yes, the way things work down here is somewhat different - in terms of changes in resort policies, etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;ve recently implemented a price break regarding outside vendor fees for couples hiring us for their wedding photography because we understand how quickly things add up with wedding plans!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We also recommend that wedding couples get their resort&#039;s latest outside vendor fee requirements from their wedding coordinators - to ensure they&#039;re working with the latest information.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing everyone happy research and all the best with their plans - cheers! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...here are a few magical wedding moments that matter to leave you with some added inspiration.....enjoy :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-c-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/1557351_10152516887594487_6618319857352960386_o.jpg\" alt=\"1557351_10152516887594487_66183198573529\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-mia.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/l\/t31.0-8\/10547793_10152659788774487_7048187345948756727_o.jpg\" alt=\"10547793_10152659788774487_7048187345948\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-a-mia.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/10397270_10152522907274487_1277997771427649578_o.jpg\" alt=\"10397270_10152522907274487_1277997771427\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1885623,"PostDate":1423414481,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hola all you planning wedding couples <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> yes, the way things work down here is somewhat different - in terms of changes in resort policies, etc.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We've recently implemented a price break regarding outside vendor fees for couples hiring us for their wedding photography because we understand how quickly things add up with wedding plans!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We also recommend that wedding couples get their resort's latest outside vendor fee requirements from their wedding coordinators - to ensure they're working with the latest information.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing everyone happy research and all the best with their plans - cheers! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...here are a few magical wedding moments that matter to leave you with some added inspiration.....enjoy <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-c-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/1557351_10152516887594487_6618319857352960386_o.jpg\" alt=\"1557351_10152516887594487_66183198573529\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-mia.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/l\/t31.0-8\/10547793_10152659788774487_7048187345948756727_o.jpg\" alt=\"10547793_10152659788774487_7048187345948\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-a-mia.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/10397270_10152522907274487_1277997771427649578_o.jpg\" alt=\"10397270_10152522907274487_1277997771427\"><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280214260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.151.178.49","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78746,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1434600269,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9b1dcbccdb57b0ab85abe2b1c3bbed1b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey ladies. you need to check out tygrlily&#039;s planning thread. she just got married on Dec 19th at beach palace and she has a fabulous thread!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886284,"PostDate":1423836379,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey ladies. you need to check out tygrlily's planning thread. she just got married on Dec 19th at beach palace and she has a fabulous thread!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78746,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d0bd7b8004632a8ffde5d3a3472b53bf","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1886284\" timestamp=\"1423832779\"]\nHey ladies. you need to check out tygrlily&#039;s planning thread. she just got married on Dec 19th at beach palace and see has a fabulous thread!![\/quote]Thanks! I have :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1886299,"PostDate":1423843760,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 13 February 2015 - 02:06 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hey ladies. you need to check out tygrlily's planning thread. she just got married on Dec 19th at beach palace and see has a fabulous thread!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Thanks! I have <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419441414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.41.201.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78746,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bfa8068b199c9299040c1cd00b8cbe0a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"perianjay\"] hi! I realize I&#039;m pretty late to this thread - I was just searching to see if there were any other beach palace threads out there and found this one. &amp;nbsp;I just wanted to let you know that I am also having my reception on the sky bar terrace, and Grupo Gama is not charging me an extra set up fee for lights! &amp;nbsp;Latinasia was going to charge me for only one side ($299 instead of $499), but I&#039;ve heard from other brides that they weren&#039;t charged by Latinasia at all. &amp;nbsp;If you are still being charged $499 for setup, you may want to mention that!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897855,"PostDate":1433366389,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> hi! I realize I'm pretty late to this thread - I was just searching to see if there were any other beach palace threads out there and found this one. \u00a0I just wanted to let you know that I am also having my reception on the sky bar terrace, and Grupo Gama is not charging me an extra set up fee for lights! \u00a0Latinasia was going to charge me for only one side ($299 instead of $499), but I've heard from other brides that they weren't charged by Latinasia at all. \u00a0If you are still being charged $499 for setup, you may want to mention that!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erikahime@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.191.153.24","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421821507,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281815.jpg?_r=1431031761","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":278,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Danielle1","Id":281815,"Name":"Danielle1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.167.38.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78746,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8fa3654ce938d37c43845120b2eb6260","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Wafflesmom\"] hi and congrats on your wedding!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;re also having our cocktail hour at&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Tucan Garden and reception at Tucan Terrace.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;I&#039;m a little concerned about the&amp;nbsp;lighting&amp;nbsp;for the reception (planning&amp;nbsp;for 6 pm - 10 pm).&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;What type of lighting are you planning to use?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;I&#039;m debating&amp;nbsp;between&amp;nbsp;getting a DJ package with the LED lights since the terrace has the&amp;nbsp;light poles. I may also get&amp;nbsp;Chinese&amp;nbsp;lanterns if Gama gives us a good deal :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Thanks&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;D&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898644,"PostDate":1434433214,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279721\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279721-wafflesmom\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Wafflesmom<\/span><\/a> hi and congrats on your wedding!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We're also having our cocktail hour at\u00a0<span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Tucan Garden and reception at Tucan Terrace.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span>I'm a little concerned about the\u00a0lighting\u00a0for the reception (planning\u00a0for 6 pm - 10 pm).<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span>What type of lighting are you planning to use?\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span>I'm debating\u00a0between\u00a0getting a DJ package with the LED lights since the terrace has the\u00a0light poles. I may also get\u00a0Chinese\u00a0lanterns if Gama gives us a good deal <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span>Thanks\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span>D<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"calipso78@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.223.28.9","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362601629,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266979.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DianaSRZ","Id":266979,"Name":"DianaSRZ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78746,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"902655e5b3b5ffa453fe815e9845ac5a","RawContent":"@[member=\"DianaSRZ\"] I really wanted a lot of lights so I&#039;ve rented 4 strings of paper lanterns from LatinAsia, booked the lights and DJ package from PSAV, and our tall centrepieces also have led lights! Our reception will also be for 6-10 pm. \n\n\nHow is your planning coming along?","Attachments":[],"Id":1898718,"PostDate":1434516085,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"266979\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/266979-dianasrz\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">DianaSRZ<\/span><\/a> I really wanted a lot of lights so I've rented 4 strings of paper lanterns from LatinAsia, booked the lights and DJ package from PSAV, and our tall centrepieces also have led lights! Our reception will also be for 6-10 pm. <br><br>\nHow is your planning coming along?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410102185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1431039162","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.223.89.93","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78746,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f0a5d3b1da45e938ae741b66251260e9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Wafflesmom\"] not bad at all! I just wish I was able to see an actual wedding at this location to have a better idea!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I was planning to only add 2 strings of Chinese lanterns but know I&#039;m not sure :mellow:&amp;nbsp;! decisions! decisions!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;re bringing our own centerpieces (very simple ivory kissing balls with submersible led lights and a few more LED tea lights around the table.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So far I received only an estimate from Gama and I need to check out the prices from the other approved vendors.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;Once I get this information, I&#039;ll feel a lot better! What about you?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898728,"PostDate":1434519457,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279721\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279721-wafflesmom\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Wafflesmom<\/span><\/a> not bad at all! I just wish I was able to see an actual wedding at this location to have a better idea!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was planning to only add 2 strings of Chinese lanterns but know I'm not sure <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/mellow.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':mellow:' \/>\u00a0! decisions! decisions!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We're bringing our own centerpieces (very simple ivory kissing balls with submersible led lights and a few more LED tea lights around the table.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So far I received only an estimate from Gama and I need to check out the prices from the other approved vendors.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0Once I get this information, I'll feel a lot better! What about you?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"calipso78@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.223.28.9","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362601629,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266979.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DianaSRZ","Id":266979,"Name":"DianaSRZ","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78746","Title":"Any Tips?! - Beach Palace, Cancun Bride","LastPostDate":1434519457},"Pages":{"TotalItems":20,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
