s for the warm welcome, am I really the first Curacao bride? I will let you know how it was....4 months to go ;-)<br \/> <br \/> A question: what does STD means? (I'm Dutch never heard of it LOL)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>---------------------------------------------------<\/span><br><br><span>Curacao, 11.7.2008<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"micklinn@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1215281087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210333.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MickiBee","Id":210333,"Name":"MickiBee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":19559,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d4c17ef461e8edc82d4e99d7c02449a5","RawContent":"Welcome to the forum, it&#039;s great to have you here!!","Attachments":[],"Id":372330,"PostDate":1215550042,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Welcome to the forum, it's great to have you here!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"robyn.mumford@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1185231720,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207553.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Robyn Louise Photography","Id":207553,"Name":"Robyn Louise Photography","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":19559,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"59ad0fded6672d72541e7798ec8cd1f8","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;MickiBee&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;A question: what does STD means? (I&#039;m Dutch never heard of it LOL)&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;LOL!\n \n STD (for our purposes here) = &amp;quot;Save The Date&amp;quot;\n &lt;i&gt;not to be confused with &amp;quot;sexually transmitted disease!&amp;quot;&lt;\/i&gt;\n \n welcome to the forum! i originally was looking at breezes curacao for my destination wedding. i don&#039;t know anyone who has been to that resort or anyone who has been married in curacao, but the few people i know who have vacationed there LOVED it, even more so than aruba!\n \n best of luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":372971,"PostDate":1215574841,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>MickiBee<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">A question: what does STD means? (I'm Dutch never heard of it LOL)<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>LOL!<br \/> <br \/> STD (for our purposes here) = \"Save The Date\"<br \/> <i>not to be confused with \"sexually transmitted disease!\"<\/i><br \/> <br \/> welcome to the forum! i originally was looking at breezes curacao for my destination wedding. i don't know anyone who has been to that resort or anyone who has been married in curacao, but the few people i know who have vacationed there LOVED it, even more so than aruba!<br \/> <br \/> best of luck!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:10px;\"><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/thread\/48680\/mummergirl-s-totally-after-the-fact-planning-thread#post_963823\">My After-the-Fact Planning Thread<\/a><\/span>","Email":"mummergirl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.83.34.78","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1207110360,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208981.jpg?_r=1389220347","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cougs","Id":208981,"Name":"cougs","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"