{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":1948,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":8,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":155697,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1521871,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":245483,"Name":"IdoBeach2012","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245483.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1316479414,"LastPoster":{"Id":283264,"Name":"stephygirl","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283264.jpg?_r=1432750548","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":2,"Preview":{"Id":1901278,"PostDate":1438039052,"PostContent":"@Danielle1 I'm actually planning on having 90-95 people and we are sticking with the sky bar sout...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yarberjl@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.124.7.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419801000,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281504.jpeg?_r=1431459531","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsGarcia","Id":281504,"Name":"FutureMrsGarcia","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.41.201.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"76875a604391010c21696ba336769ef8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"stephygirl\"] thanks for all of the info! I think I will wait a bit and see what our final numbers are... I think some people who intend to come won&#039;t actually come (is it bad that I wouldn&#039;t be too disappointed if we had less people? HA!). So far only 75 have actually booked rooms. &amp;nbsp;The picture on the link you sent me said 180 with a buffet on the Sky Bar South... however we really like to dance, so I want plenty of room for the dance floor!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901267,"PostDate":1438030771,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283264\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283264-stephygirl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">stephygirl<\/span><\/a> thanks for all of the info! I think I will wait a bit and see what our final numbers are... I think some people who intend to come won't actually come (is it bad that I wouldn't be too disappointed if we had less people? HA!). So far only 75 have actually booked rooms. \u00a0The picture on the link you sent me said 180 with a buffet on the Sky Bar South... however we really like to dance, so I want plenty of room for the dance floor!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erikahime@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.191.153.24","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421821507,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281815.jpg?_r=1431031761","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":278,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Danielle1","Id":281815,"Name":"Danielle1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.194.109.139","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b46651a0d616a0bfd02daa3e2d2448fb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Danielle1\"] - sounds like a good plan! &amp;nbsp;Yeah - I know when we first talked about doing it a lot of people said they wouldn&#039;t miss it......and then ended up not being able to make it for one reason or another! &amp;nbsp;75 is a lot though, especially so far in advance! &amp;nbsp;You should have a great time!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901274,"PostDate":1438034060,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281815\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281815-danielle1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Danielle1<\/span><\/a> - sounds like a good plan! \u00a0Yeah - I know when we first talked about doing it a lot of people said they wouldn't miss it......and then ended up not being able to make it for one reason or another! \u00a075 is a lot though, especially so far in advance! \u00a0You should have a great time!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79219-stephygirls-planning-thread-beach-palace-june-28-2015\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79219-stephygirls-planning-thread-beach-palace-june-28-2015\/<\/a>","Email":"srehm2@gmail.com","IpAddress":"167.219.0.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432742363,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283264.jpg?_r=1432750548","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stephygirl","Id":283264,"Name":"stephygirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.83.80","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by FutureMrsGarcia, 27 July 2015 - 11:18 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1438039083,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c750576d688f06e23a9670b229213d4e","RawContent":"@[member=\"Danielle1\"] I&#039;m actually planning on having 90-95 people and we are sticking with the sky bar south!! I have seen some pictures online and from my WC where there are 5-6 tables on each side with a light up dance floor in the middle and it doesn&#039;t look too cramped! I definitely do think that a party that large may fit better on the Palenque terrace but we love the space of the sky bar more and plan on partying until 12AM which can&#039;t happen on the Palenque terrace. I think you will be fine with your numbers!","Attachments":[],"Id":1901278,"PostDate":1438039052,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281815\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281815-danielle1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Danielle1<\/span><\/a> I'm actually planning on having 90-95 people and we are sticking with the sky bar south!! I have seen some pictures online and from my WC where there are 5-6 tables on each side with a light up dance floor in the middle and it doesn't look too cramped! I definitely do think that a party that large may fit better on the Palenque terrace but we love the space of the sky bar more and plan on partying until 12AM which can't happen on the Palenque terrace. I think you will be fine with your numbers!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yarberjl@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.124.7.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419801000,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281504.jpeg?_r=1431459531","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsGarcia","Id":281504,"Name":"FutureMrsGarcia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.41.201.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9ef421badadd56c77bd29fbf31960ae7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"FutureMrsGarcia\"] Thanks so much for the info! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m going to hope to stay in the 90-95 range. :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901321,"PostDate":1438098993,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281504\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281504-futuremrsgarcia\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">FutureMrsGarcia<\/span><\/a> Thanks so much for the info! \u00a0I'm going to hope to stay in the 90-95 range. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erikahime@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.191.153.24","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421821507,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281815.jpg?_r=1431031761","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":278,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Danielle1","Id":281815,"Name":"Danielle1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"167.219.0.140","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by stephygirl, 28 July 2015 - 08:44 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1438116285,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bb1fab0ae49f1c1b27d222bbdcf3fe5c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"FutureMrsGarcia\"] - so true about the partying all night thing! &amp;nbsp;Our reception was from 6 to 10pm on the Palenque, and they abruptly turned off our music at 10pm (although thankfully it was the last song anyway). &amp;nbsp;We made an announcement on the mic that an after party would be held at the Sky Bar and that everyone should change into their bathing suits to swim! &amp;nbsp;IT. WAS. AWESOME. &amp;nbsp;Such a fun after party.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901377,"PostDate":1438116259,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281504\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281504-futuremrsgarcia\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">FutureMrsGarcia<\/span><\/a> - so true about the partying all night thing! \u00a0Our reception was from 6 to 10pm on the Palenque, and they abruptly turned off our music at 10pm (although thankfully it was the last song anyway). \u00a0We made an announcement on the mic that an after party would be held at the Sky Bar and that everyone should change into their bathing suits to swim! \u00a0IT. WAS. AWESOME. \u00a0Such a fun after party.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79219-stephygirls-planning-thread-beach-palace-june-28-2015\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79219-stephygirls-planning-thread-beach-palace-june-28-2015\/<\/a>","Email":"srehm2@gmail.com","IpAddress":"167.219.0.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432742363,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283264.jpg?_r=1432750548","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stephygirl","Id":283264,"Name":"stephygirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.41.201.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2c7417237372b81a12187a8b35dad233","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"stephygirl\"] How late does the sky bar stay open? (And its only one side that is open to the public, right? So, if my reception is on the Sky Bar South, we could just go to the sky bar north when my reception ends?)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901378,"PostDate":1438116341,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283264\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283264-stephygirl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">stephygirl<\/span><\/a> How late does the sky bar stay open? (And its only one side that is open to the public, right? So, if my reception is on the Sky Bar South, we could just go to the sky bar north when my reception ends?)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erikahime@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.191.153.24","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421821507,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281815.jpg?_r=1431031761","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":278,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Danielle1","Id":281815,"Name":"Danielle1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.50.241.108","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by FutureMrsGarcia, 28 July 2015 - 09:19 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1438118342,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b3841549767d95d9c6806e82ef44aa84","RawContent":"@[member=\"stephygirl\"] Sounds like sooooo much fun! I can&#039;t decide if I&#039;m gonna get in the pool at the end. I have a feeling some will try to push me in lol @[member=\"Danielle1\"] it stays open until 2AM I think! (Can&#039;t 100% confirm that) We are having our reception until 12AM because we knew people would wanna keep the party going until AT LEAST then (some will likely go even later lol). I think only one side is open to the public so don&#039;t see why you couldn&#039;t jump over there when your reception is done!","Attachments":[],"Id":1901381,"PostDate":1438118321,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283264\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283264-stephygirl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">stephygirl<\/span><\/a> Sounds like sooooo much fun! I can't decide if I'm gonna get in the pool at the end. I have a feeling some will try to push me in lol @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281815\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281815-danielle1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Danielle1<\/span><\/a> it stays open until 2AM I think! (Can't 100% confirm that) We are having our reception until 12AM because we knew people would wanna keep the party going until AT LEAST then (some will likely go even later lol). I think only one side is open to the public so don't see why you couldn't jump over there when your reception is done!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yarberjl@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.124.7.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419801000,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281504.jpeg?_r=1431459531","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsGarcia","Id":281504,"Name":"FutureMrsGarcia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"167.219.0.140","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ad272aad56a9c354b0ae6b170f9a48ca","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Danielle1\"] - I think they technically serve drinks there from 9am to 1am. &amp;nbsp;I think the latest our group stayed out was 1am so I didn&#039;t noticed them closing anything on us. &amp;nbsp;Although the servers did leave around midnight so you&#039;d have to go to the bar to get your own drink. &amp;nbsp;Also one night they were cleaning the pool and kicked us out of the pool around 10pm. &amp;nbsp;They don&#039;t do that if there&#039;s a big group there though! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Yes, only one side open to the public - you can definitely go over to the other side any time you want!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"FutureMrsGarcia\"] - Haha sounds like you have a fun crowd going with you! &amp;nbsp;By 1am my whole group was exhausted! &amp;nbsp;People will definitely try to get you in the pool. &amp;nbsp;They tried to get me to come in but I wanted to wear my dress, and not only did I think chlorine might ruin it, but I was also worried about how long it would take to dry (and I was heading back to the states in 2 days). &amp;nbsp;I just hung out by the edge of the pool - I could have put my swimsuit on but I wanted to wear my dress as long as possible&amp;nbsp; :). &amp;nbsp;I still had such a blast there though! &amp;nbsp;Honestly the pool at the sky bar is so much fun. &amp;nbsp;Our whole group went and partied there both the rehearsal dinner night and the wedding reception night!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901524,"PostDate":1438209952,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281815\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281815-danielle1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Danielle1<\/span><\/a> - I think they technically serve drinks there from 9am to 1am. \u00a0I think the latest our group stayed out was 1am so I didn't noticed them closing anything on us. \u00a0Although the servers did leave around midnight so you'd have to go to the bar to get your own drink. \u00a0Also one night they were cleaning the pool and kicked us out of the pool around 10pm. \u00a0They don't do that if there's a big group there though! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Yes, only one side open to the public - you can definitely go over to the other side any time you want!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281504\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281504-futuremrsgarcia\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">FutureMrsGarcia<\/span><\/a> - Haha sounds like you have a fun crowd going with you! \u00a0By 1am my whole group was exhausted! \u00a0People will definitely try to get you in the pool. \u00a0They tried to get me to come in but I wanted to wear my dress, and not only did I think chlorine might ruin it, but I was also worried about how long it would take to dry (and I was heading back to the states in 2 days). \u00a0I just hung out by the edge of the pool - I could have put my swimsuit on but I wanted to wear my dress as long as possible\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. \u00a0I still had such a blast there though! \u00a0Honestly the pool at the sky bar is so much fun. \u00a0Our whole group went and partied there both the rehearsal dinner night and the wedding reception night!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79219-stephygirls-planning-thread-beach-palace-june-28-2015\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79219-stephygirls-planning-thread-beach-palace-june-28-2015\/<\/a>","Email":"srehm2@gmail.com","IpAddress":"167.219.0.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432742363,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283264.jpg?_r=1432750548","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stephygirl","Id":283264,"Name":"stephygirl","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"63613","Title":"Beach Palace Cancun Brides","LastPostDate":1438209952},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1948,"TotalPages":195,"CurrentPage":1940,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":1930,"LastPage":1940},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
